Begin3
Title:          VSBHDA
Version:        2.0
Entered-date:   2026-09-03
Description:    Sound Blaster emulation for DOS.
Summary:        Sound blaster emulation for HDA (and AC97/SBLive); a fork of crazii's SBEMU. Works with unmodified HDPMI binaries, making it compatible with HX.
Keywords:       driver, sound, emulator, audio
Author:         crazii, Japheth
Maintained-by:  Andreas "Japheth" Grech
Primary-site:   https://github.com/Baron-von-Riedesel/VSBHDA
Platforms:      DOS, FreeDOS
Copying-policy: Open source, see licenses.
End
